---
/**
 * Diagram of the example service area. It is not a traced map and not a live embed.
 */
---

<section id="map" aria-labelledby="map-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Map</p>
  <h2 id="map-heading">A map would sit here</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Placeholder diagram centred on Brisbane. It is not a live map, and the pin is not a workshop you can visit.
  </p>
  <figure class="card mt-5 overflow-hidden p-0">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="map-title map-desc">
      <title id="map-title">Service area diagram</title>
      <desc id="map-desc">
        A placeholder diagram of greater Brisbane with an example pin at Woolloongabba. Not a live map.
      </desc>
      <rect width="640" height="420" fill="#E7F0EA"></rect>
      <path
        d="M70 80c40 20 70 70 60 120-12 60 20 90 70 110 54 22 40 70 10 100-36 36-10 70 40 78 70 12 150-30 220-10 80 22 150-10 190-50 20-20 8-70-20-90-30-22-20-60 10-90 28-28 10-70-30-90-48-24-90 10-140-10-40-16-70-70-130-70-50 0-90 30-120 12-28-16-70-30-90-10z"
        fill="#EFE6D6"
        stroke="#7A7064"
        stroke-width="3"></path>
      <path
        d="M120 250c40-20 70 10 110 0s70-40 120-20 90 10 140 40"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#3E6D86"
        stroke-width="14"
        stroke-linecap="round"></path>
      <g fill="#1B3D30" font-family="Figtree, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700">
        <circle cx="230" cy="150" r="7"></circle>
        <text x="244" y="155">Chermside</text>
        <circle cx="150" cy="188" r="7"></circle>
        <text x="78" y="214">Indooroopilly</text>
        <circle cx="500" cy="300" r="7"></circle>
        <text x="430" y="332">Wynnum</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(330 168)">
        <path d="M0 28c16 0 28 12 28 28 0 22-28 48-28 48S-28 78-28 56C-28 40-16 28 0 28z" fill="#8E3E16"></path>
        <circle cy="54" r="9" fill="#F7F3EC"></circle>
        <text x="-46" y="16" fill="#1C1915" font-family="Figtree, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700">
          Example · Woolloongabba
        </text>
      </g>
      <text x="28" y="40" fill="#1C1915" font-family="Figtree, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="700">
        Diagram only
      </text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption class="px-5 py-4 text-base leading-relaxed">
      Map placeholder. A live site could embed a map of a real workshop. The river curve and suburb dots are a diagram, not a street map.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
